{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2022-08-12 19:28:00', 'title': 'MACOM TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS HOLDINGS SET TO JOIN S&P MIDCAP 400', 'text': 'NEW YORK , AUG. 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MACOM TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS HOLDINGS INC. (NASD: MTSI) WILL REPLACE SAILPOINT TECHNOLOGIES HOLDINGS INC. (NYSE: SAIL) IN THE S&P MIDCAP 400 EFFECTIVE PRIOR TO THE OPENING OF TRADING ON WEDNESDAY, AUGUST 17. THOMA BRAVA IS ACQUIRING SAILPOINT TECHNOLOGIES HOLDINGS IN A DEAL EXPECTED TO BE COMPLETED SOON PENDING FINAL CONDITIONS.'}